{"id": "51339", "title": "凝儿", "author": "阿会", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/51/51339.htm", "intro": "大难不死必有厚福，蒋悦凝这算是因祸得福吗？\r\n　　难产的经历让舅舅慕司啸意识到自己的重要性，他不能没有她。\r\n　　凝儿不知道这段恋情是否能够长久下去，\r\n　　不知道舅舅对自己是不是只是把她当做娘亲的替身一样爱恋，\r\n　　面对舅舅日益增加的关心和疼爱，\r\n　　她怯懦、不安又享受著疼爱，\r\n　　只因即使是替身也罢，爱了就爱了。\r\n　　慕司啸做事一向快准狠，\r\n　　既然凝儿已经不姓云，跟云家没有任何关系，\r\n　　她姓蒋更方便他把她娶进门，\r\n　　只是无论进门前还是进门後，\r\n　　凝儿好像都没有想象的快乐，\r\n　　这到底是为什麽？\r\n　　难道自己的所作所为还不够弥补之前的伤害吗？\r\n　　还是凝儿无法想自己一样不介意世人的眼光?\r\n　　他是她舅舅也罢，相公也罢，\r\n　　他要定了她，绝对不会让她再离开他。", "base": "files/article/html/51/51339", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "7311071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "7311075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "7311076.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "7311077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "7311078.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "7311080.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "7311081.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "7311082.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "7311084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "7311086.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "7311088.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "7311089.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "7311090.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "7311091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "7311092.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "7311093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "7311094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "7311095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "7311097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "7311102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "7311103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "7311104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "7311105.html", "availab